  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Welcome to Born to Race Threads, where you'll find apparel for infants to adults that shares a passion for racing.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>My husband and I are the founders of Born to Race Threads and we appreciate you dropping in!</p>\r\n<p>We created Born to Race Threads after we had trouble finding racing apparel that we loved for our little guy, Bentley. Our goal is to bring you the coolest&nbsp;onesies, shirts, sweatshirts and hats for the racers at heart.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The name Born to Race Threads all started based off our son&rsquo;s initials BRT, so it has a true meaning behind the name as well as a true passion for the sport of racing.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We grew up racing outlaw karts, and love helping and supporting the younger generation of racers grow and improve. We plan to pass the same passion down to our son and to your families as well.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>You are shopping with a small, family-owned company. We are big time first-responder, military, and veteran supporters and love supporting our local community.</p>\r\n<p>We want to share our passion and style with you and your families and hope that we see some Born to Race Threads at all the local tracks soon.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Be sure to check us out on Instagram and Facebook&nbsp;to hear about&nbsp;new drops, sales and giveaways.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Thank you for checking us out!</p>\r\n<p><br>&bull; Payment terms: We Pay 10% commission every 30 Days&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;Thank you,&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Born to Race Threads</p>",
